      "title": "Hidden Gem in Miraflores",
      "text": "Stumbled on this place by accident one Saturday afternoon. Food was excellent,  shared three tapas dishes between us. A decent Argentinian Malbec available by the glass, lovely decor, quiet at that time of day and service was attentive without being overbearing.\nOnly downside was they don't serve coffee to end the eating which was a minor disappointment.\nIt is a hidden gem in Miraflores only a few hundred metres from where we live so it will be getting regular visits from us in the future",
